<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <title>🐾 Heróis de Patas - Natureza</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: #0a0a1a;
            min-height: 100vh;
            overflow: hidden;
            color: #fff;
            user-select: none;
            -webkit-user-select: none;
            touch-action: none;
        }
        .hidden {
            display: none !important;
        }

        /* ===== MENU ===== */
        #menu-container {
            position: relative;
            width: 100vw;
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a0a1a, #1a1a3e, #0d1b2a);
        }
        .menu-bg {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            z-index: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
            opacity: 0.1;
        }
        .floating-paws {
            position: absolute;
            font-size: 80px;
            animation: floatPaws 25s infinite linear;
            color: #ffb300;
        }
        .floating-paws:nth-child(1) {
            top: 5%;
            left: -10%;
            animation-duration: 30s;
            font-size: 100px;
        }
        .floating-paws:nth-child(2) {
            top: 30%;
            right: -10%;
            animation-duration: 35s;
            font-size: 70px;
            animation-delay: 5s;
        }
        .floating-paws:nth-child(3) {
            bottom: 20%;
            left: -5%;
            animation-duration: 28s;
            font-size: 90px;
            animation-delay: 10s;
        }
        .floating-paws:nth-child(4) {
            bottom: 5%;
            right: -5%;
            animation-duration: 32s;
            font-size: 60px;
            animation-delay: 15s;
        }
        .floating-paws:nth-child(5) {
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            animation-duration: 40s;
            font-size: 120px;
            animation-delay: 20s;
        }
        @keyframes floatPaws {
            0% {
                transform: translate(0, 0) rotate(0) scale(1);
                opacity: 0;
            }
            10% {
                opacity: 0.3;
            }
            90% {
                opacity: 0.3;
            }
            100% {
                transform: translate(100vw, 100vh) rotate(720deg) scale(0.5);
                opacity: 0;
            }
        }

        .menu-content,
        #characters-screen,
        #credits-screen,
        #settings-screen,
        #progress-screen,
        #tutorial-screen {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px 35px;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
            border-radius: 30px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
            border: 2px solid rgba(255, 179, 0, 0.2);
            max-width: 750px;
            width: 95%;
            max-height: 95vh;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }
        .logo-icon {
            font-size: 70px;
            display: block;
            animation: bounceLogo 2s infinite ease-in-out;
        }
        @keyframes bounceLogo {
            0%,
            100% {
                transform: translateY(0) rotate(-5deg);
            }
            50% {
                transform: translateY(-15px) rotate(5deg);
            }
        }
        .game-title {
            font-size: 38px;
            font-weight: 900;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffb300, #ff6f00, #ffb300);
            background-size: 200% 200%;
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            margin: 8px 0 4px;
            animation: shimmer 3s infinite;
        }
        @keyframes shimmer {
            0%,
            100% {
                background-position: 0% 50%;
            }
            50% {
                background-position: 100% 50%;
            }
        }
        .game-subtitle {
            color: #ffcc80;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 300;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        .menu-buttons {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-top: 18px;
        }
        .menu-btn {
            padding: 14px 25px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 14px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .menu-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(255, 179, 0, 0.25);
        }
        .menu-btn:active {
            transform: scale(0.97);
        }
        .menu-btn.primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffb300, #f57f17);
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 18px;
        }
        .menu-btn.secondary {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            color: #fff;
            border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
        }
        .menu-btn.secondary:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 179, 0, 0.15);
            border-color: #ffb300;
        }
        .version-info {
            margin-top: 16px;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        #characters-screen h2,
        #credits-screen h2,
        #settings-screen h2,
        #progress-screen h2,
        #tutorial-screen h2 {
            font-size: 28px;
            color: #ffb300;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .characters-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(170px, 1fr));
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .char-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 12px;
            text-align: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: 2px solid transparent;
        }
        .char-card:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }
        .char-card.selected {
            border-color: #ffb300;
            background: rgba(255, 179, 0, 0.15);
        }
        .char-card.main {
            border-color: #ffb300;
            background: rgba(255, 179, 0, 0.12);
            grid-column: span 2;
        }
        .char-avatar {
            font-size: 42px;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }
        .char-name {
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #fff;
        }
        .char-title {
            font-size: 9px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #ffb300;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin: 2px 0 3px;
        }
        .char-desc {
            font-size: 10px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        .credits-content {
            text-align: center;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
        }
        .credits-content strong {
            color: #ffb300;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .progress-container {
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .progress-bar {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 10px;
            height: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 179, 0, 0.3);
        }
        .progress-fill {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ffb300, #f57f17);
            height: 100%;
            transition: width 0.5s ease;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #000;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .progress-stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 15px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .stat-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            border-left: 3px solid #ffb300;
        }
        .stat-card .label {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .stat-card .value {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #ffb300;
        }

        /* ===== JOGO ===== */
        #game-container {
            position: relative;
            width: 100vw;
            height: 100vh;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #5ba3d0, #b8e6f0 60%, #c8e6a0);
        }
        #game-canvas {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            touch-action: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        #hud {
            position: absolute;
            top: 8px;
            left: 8px;
            right: 8px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-start;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 10;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 4px;
        }
        .hud-left,
        .hud-right {
            display: flex;
            gap: 6px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .hud-item {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #fff;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 4px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            pointer-events: auto;
        }
        .hud-item .icon {
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .hud-item .value {
            color: #ffb300;
        }

        #quest-hud {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50px;
            right: 10px;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            padding: 10px 14px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border-left: 3px solid #ffb300;
            z-index: 10;
            pointer-events: none;
            min-width: 170px;
            font-size: 13px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 5px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }
        .quest-item {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            padding: 4px 6px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .quest-item.completed {
            color: #4caf50;
            background: rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.15);
            border-left: 2px solid #4caf50;
        }
        .quest-item .emoji {
            font-size: 16px;
            width: 24px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .quest-item .count {
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .quest-item .label {
            flex: 1;
        }

        #pause-overlay,
        #game-over,
        #transition-overlay,
        #mission-complete,
        #memory-overlay {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            display: none;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            flex-direction: column;
            z-index: 50;
            padding: 16px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        #pause-overlay.active,
        #game-over.active,
        #mission-complete.show,
        #memory-overlay.active {
            display: flex;
        }
        #pause-overlay {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88);
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            gap: 12px;
        }
        #pause-overlay h2 {
            font-size: 40px;
            color: #ffb300;
            animation: pulsePause 1.5s infinite ease-in-out;
        }
        @keyframes pulsePause {
            0%,
            100% {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: scale(1);
            }
            50% {
                opacity: 0.6;
                transform: scale(1.05);
            }
        }
        .pause-btn {
            padding: 12px 30px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            color: #fff;
            border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            min-width: 170px;
        }
        .pause-btn:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 179, 0, 0.15);
            border-color: #ffb300;
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }
        .pause-btn.primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffb300, #f57f17);
            border: none;
        }
        .pause-btn.primary:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(255, 179, 0, 0.3);
        }

        #transition-overlay {
            background: #000;
            z-index: 60;
            pointer-events: none;
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity 0.6s ease;
            display: block;
        }
        #transition-overlay.active {
            opacity: 1;
            pointer-events: auto;
        }

        #mission-complete {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 3px solid #ffb300;
            z-index: 55;
            pointer-events: none;
            animation: popIn 0.5s ease;
            padding: 30px 50px;
            max-width: 500px;
            margin: auto;
        }
        #mission-complete h2 {
            font-size: 36px;
            color: #ffb300;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        #mission-complete p {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
        }
        @keyframes popIn {
            0% {
                transform: scale(0.7) rotate(-5deg);
                opacity: 0;
            }
            100% {
                transform: scale(1) rotate(0deg);
                opacity: 1;
            }
        }

        #memory-overlay {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            z-index: 45;
            animation: fadeInMemory 1.5s ease;
        }
        @keyframes fadeInMemory {
            0% {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: scale(0.95);
            }
            100% {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: scale(1);
            }
        }
        #memory-box {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff8e1, #fce4ec);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 30px 35px;
            max-width: 450px;
            width: 100%;
            border: 3px solid #ff6f91;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(255, 111, 145, 0.3);
            animation: gentleFloat 3s infinite ease-in-out;
        }
        @keyframes gentleFloat {
            0%,
            100% {
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
            50% {
                transform: translateY(-8px);
            }
        }
        #memory-box .memory-avatar {
            font-size: 72px;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        #memory-box h2 {
            color: #e91e63;
            font-size: 24px;
            margin: 4px 0;
            font-weight: 900;
        }
        #memory-box .memory-quote {
            font-size: 22px;
            color: #4a148c;
            font-style: italic;
            line-height: 1.6;
            padding: 10px 0;
            border-top: 2px solid rgba(255, 111, 145, 0.3);
            border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(255, 111, 145, 0.3);
        }
        #memory-box .memory-btn {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff6f91, #e91e63);
            border: none;
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 16px;
            padding: 12px 32px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            margin-top: 12px;
        }
        #memory-box .memory-btn:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(255, 111, 145, 0.4);
        }

        #game-over {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.92);
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            z-index: 50;
            gap: 10px;
        }
        #game-over h2 {
            font-size: 38px;
            color: #ffb300;
        }
        #game-over .sub {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
        }

        #controls-hint {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 10px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            padding: 4px 14px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 10px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
            z-index: 10;
            pointer-events: none;
            white-space: nowrap;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .game-title {
                font-size: 28px;
            }
            .menu-content {
                padding: 20px;
            }
            #quest-hud {
                top: 45px;
                right: 6px;
                min-width: 140px;
                font-size: 11px;
                padding: 8px 10px;
            }
            .quest-item {
                font-size: 11px;
            }
            #mission-complete {
                padding: 20px 30px;
            }
            #mission-complete h2 {
                font-size: 28px;
            }
            .characters-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
            .char-card.main {
                grid-column: span 2;
            }
        }
        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .game-title {
                font-size: 22px;
            }
            #quest-hud {
                min-width: 110px;
                font-size: 9px;
                padding: 4px 6px;
                gap: 2px;
            }
            .quest-item {
                font-size: 9px;
                padding: 2px 3px;
            }
            .quest-item .emoji {
                font-size: 12px;
                width: 18px;
            }
            #controls-hint {
                font-size: 8px;
                padding: 2px 10px;
            }
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 4px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            border-radius: 10px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #ffb300;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- ===== MENU ===== -->
    <div id="menu-container">
        <div class="menu-bg">
            <div class="floating-paws">🐾</div>
            <div class="floating-paws">🐾</div>
            <div class="floating-paws">🐾</div>
            <div class="floating-paws">🐾</div>
            <div class="floating-paws">🐾</div>
        </div>
        <div id="menu-content" class="menu-content">
            <div class="logo-container">
                <span class="logo-icon">🐾</span>
                <h1 class="game-title">HERÓIS DE PATAS</h1>
                <p class="game-subtitle">🐶 Aventura na Natureza</p>
                <p style="font-size:13px; color:#ffb300; margin-top:2px;">🌟 Escolha seu Herói!</p>
            </div>
            <div class="menu-buttons">
                <button id="btn-new-game" class="menu-btn primary">▶ NOVA AVENTURA</button>
                <button id="btn-continue" class="menu-btn secondary">↻ CONTINUAR</button>
                <button id="btn-characters" class="menu-btn secondary">👥 PERSONAGENS</button>
                <button id="btn-progress" class="menu-btn secondary">📊 PROGRESSO</button>
                <button id="btn-tutorial" class="menu-btn secondary">📖 TUTORIAL</button>
                <button id="btn-credits" class="menu-btn secondary">💝 CRÉDITOS</button>
            </div>
            <div class="version-info">v6.2 · Fases funcionando</div>
        </div>

        <!-- ===== PROGRESSO ===== -->
        <div id="progress-screen" class="hidden">
            <h2>📊 Progresso</h2>
            <div class="progress-container">
                <div style="text-align:center; margin-bottom:10px;"><span style="font-size:14px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);">Fases Completadas</span></div>
                <div class="progress-bar">
                    <div id="progress-fill" style="width:0%; height:100%;" class="progress-fill">0%</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="progress-stats">
                <div class="stat-card"><span class="label">🦴 Ossos</span><div class="value" id="progress-bones">0</div></div>
                <div class="stat-card"><span class="label">🪙 Moedas</span><div class="value" id="progress-coins">0</div></div>
                <div class="stat-card"><span class="label">❤️ Corações</span><div class="value" id="progress-hearts">0</div></div>
                <div class="stat-card"><span class="label">👾 Inimigos</span><div class="value" id="progress-kills">0</div></div>
                <div class="stat-card" style="grid-column:span 2;"><span class="label">📍 Fase Atual</span><div class="value" id="progress-phase">1</div></div>
            </div>
            <button id="btn-back-progress" class="menu-btn secondary" style="margin-top:20px;">← VOLTAR</button>
        </div>

        <!-- ===== TUTORIAL ===== -->
        <div id="tutorial-screen" class="hidden">
            <h2>📖 Tutorial</h2>
            <div style="text-align:left; margin:20px 0;">
                <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding:20px; border-radius:12px; border-left:4px solid #ffb300; margin:15px 0;">
                    <h3 style="color:#ffb300; margin-bottom:10px;">⬅️ ➡️ Movimentação</h3>
                    <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);">Use as SETAS ou WASD para mover seu herói.</p>
                </div>
                <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding:20px; border-radius:12px; border-left:4px solid #ffb300; margin:15px 0;">
                    <h3 style="color:#ffb300; margin-bottom:10px;">⬆️ Pulo</h3>
                    <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);">Pressione ESPAÇO para pular. Pule sobre os inimigos para derrotá-los!</p>
                </div>
                <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding:20px; border-radius:12px; border-left:4px solid #ffb300; margin:15px 0;">
                    <h3 style="color:#ffb300; margin-bottom:10px;">🎯 Objetivos</h3>
                    <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);">Colete TODOS os ossos, moedas, corações e derrote TODOS os 5 inimigos.</p>
                </div>
                <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding:20px; border-radius:12px; border-left:4px solid #ffb300; margin:15px 0;">
                    <h3 style="color:#ffb300; margin-bottom:10px;">🏁 Bandeira Final</h3>
                    <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);">Ao chegar na bandeira dourada, se todos os objetivos estiverem concluídos, a fase termina!</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <button id="btn-back-tutorial" class="menu-btn secondary" style="margin-top:20px;">← VOLTAR</button>
        </div>

        <!-- ===== CRÉDITOS ===== -->
        <div id="credits-screen" class="hidden">
            <h2>💝 Créditos</h2>
            <div class="credits-content">
                <p><strong>🐾 HERÓIS DE PATAS</strong></p>
                <p>Uma aventura dedicada a todos os animais</p><br>
